[4.928, "o", "[main] UNTRUSTED WEB SEARCH RESULTS for: latest AI models release 2025\r\nProvider: duckduckgo\r\n1. [Latest AI Model Releases: July 2026 Timeline - PromptZone](https://www.promptzone.com/ai-model-releases)\r\n   \"2026年7月24日·Latest AI Model Releases: July 2026 Timeline AI Model Releases 2026 Timeline A chronological timeline of major AI model releases across 2025 and 2026 — LLMs, reasoning models, open-weights families, and image & video generators, each with its date, why it mattered, and the official announcement. Newest model launches — live\"\r\n2. [AI Model Release Tracker - Latest Releases | LM Market Cap](https://lmmarketcap.com/tools/model-release-tracker)\r\n   New AI models launch weekly across major providers. The pace has accelerated - in 2025-2026, major providers average a new model or update every 2-4 weeks. Open-source releases happen almost daily.\r\n3. [AI Model Release Tracker — Evertune](https://models.evertune.ai/)\r\n   Track every major AI model release from OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, Met"]
[0.000, "o", "a, DeepSeek, and more. Updated daily with release dates, descriptions, and official announcements.\r\n4. [OpenAI Models — 41 Releases & Benchmarks](https://aireleasetracker.com/company/openai)\r\n   \"2026年7月17日·Every AI model released by OpenAI: 41 models tracked, from the first public release through GPT-5.6 Sol on Jun 26 2026. Release dates, GPQA Diamond and SWE-Bench Verified benchmark scores, parameters, and context windows.\"\r\n5. [New AI Model Releases - Latest AI Models Released Today](https://aiflashreport.com/topics/new-ai-model-releases.html)\r\n   2026年7月22日·Track new AI model releases updated daily. Latest model launches, specs, and availability from OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, Meta, Mistral, and more.\r\n6. [China tops global AI development with 1,509 large models](https://global.chinadaily.com.cn/a/202507/28/WS6887269fa310c26fd717c174.html)\r\n   1 天前·Robot dogs and a humanoid robot, independently developed by a Chinese enterprise, were showcased during the 2025 World AI Conference in Sh"]
[0.000, "o", "anghai, on July 27, 2025. [Photo/Xinhua] China has accelerated breakthroughs in artificial intelligence development, having released 1,509 large models to date, ranking first among the 3,755 large models released globally, according to a Xinhua report citing ...\r\n7. [AI Model Releases - New Launches & Updates | LM Market Cap](https://lmmarketcap.com/releases)\r\n   2 天前·AI Model Releases Follow new launches, provider release velocity, and category-level freshness. This page is designed to make the product feel current even between direct comparisons.\r\n8. [AI Model Releases Timeline | DemandSphere](https://www.demandsphere.com/research/demandsphere-radar/ai-frontier-model-tracker/releases/)\r\n   2026年7月19日·Chronological timeline of every frontier AI model release. Track new launches from OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, xAI, Meta, DeepSeek, and more.\r\n9. [AI Model Release Timeline 2025-2026 — benchr](https://benchr.org/timeline)\r\n   2026年7月21日·Chronological timeline of major AI model releases throu"]
[0.000, "o", "gh July 23, 2026, with release dates, sourced pricing, access status, and key specifications.\r\n10. [New Models Today — AI & LLM Releases - Price Per Token](https://pricepertoken.com/news/model-releases)\r\n   今天·New models released today and in the last 24 hours. Daily changelog of new AI and LLM releases from OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, Meta, Mistral and more.\r\n[main] step: tools\r\n[main] tool result: web_search\r\n"]
